**Oni** are Japanese ogres with horned, demonic faces and unearthly
red or blue skin, said to carry iron clubs and possess tremendous
strength. Not every oni is evil, but inviting one to tea to find out
may be unwise. *Attack (Iron Club) +1, Intimidating +2, Strong +2,
Tough +2; Awkward Size (Big) -1, Bizarre Appearance -3, Short-Tempered
-2, Slow -1.*

